window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Politics is fair game, until someone breaks the rules…</b></p> <p>In the aftermath of solving a gruesome investigation, FBI Agent Allie Bishop is called out to Boise to assist with a case. Someone is targeting public officials with extreme malice and leaving no trail.</p> <p>After escaping a near-death assault on her way out of town, Allie's mind is teeming with new questions and old fears. Who was the mysterious man who had tried to warn her, and who were the people who so clearly wanted to see her dead?</p> <p>Navigating a new field office and a new partner, Allie is forced to confront her own weaknesses while juggling fresh concerns about her family's past. It's all getting to be a little much, and it just might do her in.</p> <p><i>Don't miss the next thrilling installment in the celebrated Allie Bishop FBI Mystery Thriller Series.</i></p>"; 
